{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>李日朗（Don）舊愛黃靜藍（Nam）於2024年底宣布與飲食才俊劉永燊（Wilson）閃婚，並火速造人成功，去年8月平安誕下愛女Sienna，組織幸福三人家庭。今年年初，黃靜藍與老公補辦奢華盛大婚禮，9月她再報喜宣布懷上第二胎，成功「三年抱兩」！日前黃靜藍在社交平台上載短片，分享懷孕前後的身材對比，自嘲短短9個月便「摧毀」過往苦練的修身成果，畫面相當震撼！</p><figure><img alt=\"黃靜藍（Nam）於2024年底宣布與飲食才俊劉永燊（Wilson）閃婚。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161152881922048685924.jpeg/wwbWDm-9OA3Az0ORk4MW72QbBGaU6lrmnO8NhJzvDYQ\"/><figcaption>黃靜藍（Nam）於2024年底宣布與飲食才俊劉永燊（Wilson）閃婚。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家三口幸福美滿。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161155805483008672918.jpeg/S7s9Txd2favEJGdATKAxL67yIhFHrjDU3PSIh9z0iIc\"/><figcaption>一家三口幸福美滿。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"放閃！（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161157257105408549683.jpeg/LfC8XEYBSjJpm1iI-5J3ZiUb9PmDBxIjC3oOYAt6DmA\"/><figcaption>放閃！（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2025年8月誕下長女「Baby Sienna」。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177567295950557184612843.jpeg/H-pww-2ImijOW__Fo3sAujGjmaT1z_eL1TAvYNUwL2A\"/><figcaption>2025年8月誕下長女「Baby Sienna」。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"今年9月黃靜藍宣布「BABY LAU 2 Coming Soon」！（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180269444228845568984165.jpeg/Gl_sT_XA3anXNoBR4EcVYSHuozWN2qxje8WFsXvFhbE\"/><figcaption>今年9月黃靜藍宣布「BABY LAU 2 Coming Soon」！（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"即將迎接家庭新成員的到來！（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180269441678577664950683.jpeg/DqXk0kPKuL-FsPA7mO8RZmGFSN0uqDIziyw3CYssNwk\"/><figcaption>即將迎接家庭新成員的到來！（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><p>黃靜藍對比懷孕前後身材變化　自嘲「摧毀咗我之前9個月嘅努力」</p><p>黃靜藍曬出多張產後努力修身回復Fit爆身材的靚相，馬甲線清晰可見，腰肢纖細零贅肉，完全不似生過BB！然而畫面一轉，黃靜藍隨即曬出目前懷第二胎的近照，只見她的孕肚已明顯巨大，與昔日纖腰形成強烈對比！黃靜藍無奈又搞笑地寫道：「只需要9個月，就摧毁咗我之前9月嘅努力☺️個肚皮就可以撐到咁樣🤍各位媽媽共勉之🥹一齊努力搵返條腰！」雖然自嘲身材「走樣」，但黃靜藍依然得天獨厚，四肢依然纖瘦，並特意拍攝了一輯極具仙氣的薄紗孕婦寫真，輕撫孕肚展露燦爛甜笑，母愛滿瀉。</p><figure><img alt=\"大曬纖腰。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161154786529280415329.jpeg/6b4GKr2jB_qms9S3Grp0Gm59n2zqRPEeDS3IqQ0tyKk\"/><figcaption>大曬纖腰。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Fit。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161152479531008904563.jpeg/j8pFIJjsyAVK2cn7xXyhAnE5QJ5VG4JRtvy6Mrb8ujI\"/><figcaption>Fit。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"積極修身。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161149975400448276380.jpeg/n5y8xi3l0t0Emcu9O4QgVBDzSoQEJhjtF84NvhfODb4\"/><figcaption>積極修身。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"零贅肉。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161147647430656109245.jpeg/V7Ext3wbNiykwno02vgOqO9TNiZhO4cJWNXnJFjV5yQ\"/><figcaption>零贅肉。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馬甲線。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161157361963008706138.jpeg/bTp8FG1-hv_-yS6Pt7Bqb6L5wpCHDJJV0HNN-dBzTfk\"/><figcaption>馬甲線。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬巨肚！（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161155168210944789534.jpeg/N3Ag4dN72F_iS2lAlGTq0fRUPFNmPx91p42e0qeNntI\"/><figcaption>大曬巨肚！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"打回原形。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161152940904448738496.jpeg/ATMLbrk5rGlqMe5zlRi6-pSquqdpQlDqdxlRAXcZUQE\"/><figcaption>打回原形。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"孕照。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161150407413760932845.jpeg/zl9TTWoedDxhkNOChRiDgo-yapOi7UQHguspiILrKYg\"/><figcaption>孕照。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"四肢依然纖幼。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200161147634847744351489.jpeg/2sQLFosnANcZQFw4OCmNPAwsnDDkhL1jYUziG2FM4hs\"/><figcaption>四肢依然纖幼。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫馨。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180269804297392128309574.jpeg/CE5uEjzS1IYQ0SvCgoASt2KO9RNuXUeuiytftIsrX7Q\"/><figcaption>溫馨。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Sweet！（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260925/1180269800010551296364571.jpeg/0sKkOJE7WYAIOq4JFPfgOGRvUtwOCiC3IHkddiB5HXY\"/><figcaption>Sweet！（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><p>黃靜藍閃嫁飲食才俊　婚禮極盡奢華婚後生活富貴無憂</p><p>今年年初黃靜藍與老公補辦婚禮，婚宴極具排場，新娘身上掛滿份量十足的金器，當中包括至少十對龍鳳鈪，頸上更掛住金豬牌，貴氣逼人。黃靜藍婚後經常在社交平台大曬富貴生活，她曾在接受《香港01》訪問時否認自己嫁入豪門：「豪門？唔係嘅，一個比較富裕啲嘅家庭，但又冇去到咁誇張，唔係唔係。我覺得嫁入乜嘢家庭都好，要做好自己嘅工作，咁我又唔係要好依靠男家嗰邊，自己都係財政獨立、工作獨立。」據知黃靜藍老公劉永燊畢業於英國倫敦國王學院法律系，早年已成立印刷公司，其後陸續開辦三間公司，現已坐擁屬於自己的飲食王國，身家豐厚。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃靜藍與老公今年年初補辦婚禮。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177566845314535424918245.jpeg/M0I8AwoZKzAMBGpQvmN1eYAqCv2vEyBeROnnVETp51Q\"/><figcaption>黃靜藍與老公今年年初補辦婚禮。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞斯萊斯做婚車。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177566857339998208345296.jpeg/9LqhpMWsdHOgrin1XiFwWQ3rhfefNeua_MMWT_zDFk8\"/><figcaption>勞斯萊斯做婚車。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃靜藍化身黃金聖鬥士。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177566859730882560416072.jpeg/7aEsbQY53_yAuO99nhaa5qwW3NDgYALhTdfOnU3Xzp0\"/><figcaption>黃靜藍化身黃金聖鬥士。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"戴滿巨型金器超震撼。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177566855200772096582104.jpeg/JvvHXanJOy9ZFHbasgzWrmKCQnmdtPvfvkUMXL5FDFw\"/><figcaption>戴滿巨型金器超震撼。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"郎才女貌。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200162338452279296263981.jpeg/jLM-tyO6_M7LZqLEvlwDkhVVxDylG6RkgwSbKYMEmyk\"/><figcaption>郎才女貌。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Sweet！（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177566852994437120194730.jpeg/R_CS1MchbOM0LO9qfzY8r0jVvME9o5G9o5MOxqOTDsY\"/><figcaption>Sweet！（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鑽石頸鏈超吸睛。（IG@bluenamchu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260918/1177566850754547712248695.jpeg/3X5YWO6QUbOAhT6CooczC1QtcwfcfiriDge5Jg4HuSY\"/><figcaption>鑽石頸鏈超吸睛。（IG@bluenamchu）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:23:53.260964+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1270,"images":24,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:46.581196+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:17:25.994347+00:00","content_hash":"1ba6ff51face796e981f5277066756fbda95b70da13d4c92ef2d8fadaaf681a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}